INSERT INTO SECTIONS(annotationid, sectionnumber, sectionname, startime, endtime, notes) VALUES (1,5, "A’’", 158, 185, "• The old observatory overlooked a valley where morning fog lingered long after sunrise.\\n• Copper leaves drifted across the stone path, gathering in quiet corners beneath the benches.\\n• A distant train echoed through the hills while the town slowly came to life.\\n• Every clock in the workshop ticked at a slightly different rhythm, creating a gentle chorus.\\n• Fresh bread, roasted coffee, and rain-soaked pavement filled the cool autumn air.\\n• Hidden among the shelves was a journal containing sketches, maps, and unfinished ideas.\\n• The lighthouse beam swept across the waves, disappearing briefly behind rolling mist.\\n• Bright constellations emerged one by one as the last streaks of orange faded from the horizon.\\n• Engineers adjusted the final parameters before initiating the overnight systems test.\\n• Even the smallest details often reveal the most interesting stories when examined closely" )
